 * PCB AI route panel â€” style matches schematic AiSettingsPanelï¼ˆå«æ¨ç†å¼€å…³ï¼‰ã€‚
 * API config shared via AiApiConfigSection / same vault / aiEnableReasoning.
 * å¼€å§‹å‰å¼¹çª—ç¡®è®¤å¸ƒçº¿é“œå±‚æ•°ï¼ˆ2/4/6/8ï¼‰ï¼›QA ä»å¯ raiseCopperã€‚
